[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H1FWT-30
TITLE: Input Signals
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware enables an IO input interrupt for determining when to start the timer count. This
interrupt is configured to trip on the signal rising edge.

The firmware reads an IO input which is either pulled up or down to determine the I2C slave
address to be used.

The firmware utilizes external crystal input as the clock source for its peripheral hardware so that
accurate timing counts may be produced.
<<<
